  "deletedBy": null,
  "details": "Hey!\n\nSo there are certain notifications for things like drops or bundles that I don't have any interest in interacting with and would like to opt out or turn off entirely. I can understand having a notification pop up for a brand new feature added to the game to show me that it exists. However, if I have no interest in interacting with it or staying up to date with a particular feature, I'd like to turn off notifications or pings for it entirely. \n\nI get that it's only a few clicks to make it go away, but I'd just rather not have to do that, especially when testing world/avatar features that I need to open a new game client for. \n\nTLDR: do not make me have to claim bundles and similar upon login, or at least stop pinging me for new ones. Let me decide whether I want to get notifications for it.",
